{
 "id": "prefix-2",
 "part": "Β",
 "el": "Προθήματα από προθέσεις (Β)",
 "title": "Prepositional prefixes II: επι-, κατα-, μετα-, παρα-, περι-, προ-, προσ-",
 "level": "A2–C1",
 "intro": [
  {
   "p": "The second set of prepositional prefixes. **παρα-** is the one to watch: it means *beside*, *wrongly* or *too much*, and the colloquial *too much* sense is fully productive, so you can make new verbs with it yourself (παρατρώω, παρακοιμάμαι, παραλέω)."
  }
 ],
